{{!
    @template local_oksigeniaayvurenda/record_covers
    @copyright  2026 Oksigenia SL <dev@oksigenia.cc>
    @license    https://www.gnu.org/copyleft/gpl.html GNU GPL v3 or later

    «¿Es esta?»: the covers found by title and author for a record without one, up to six, each with its publisher and
    year beside the ones of this record, so that the one of this edition is told apart. One touch puts it; none is
    put by itself. «Ninguna es esta» keeps the drawn cover; a photo is the other way.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * heading, hint, thisline, action, sesskey, list (key, src, line, same, samelabel, picklabel), nonelabel, photolabel,
      photourl

    Example context (json):
    {"heading": "¿Es esta la portada?", "hint": "Toca la de este libro.", "thisline": "Este libro: Alisio, 2014",
        "action": "#", "sesskey": "abc", "list": [{"key": "ol1", "src": "https://example.com/c.jpg", "line": "Alisio · 2014",
        "same": true, "samelabel": "Misma editorial y año", "picklabel": "Poner esta"}], "nonelabel": "Ninguna es esta",
        "photolabel": "Hacerle una foto", "photourl": "#"}
}}
<section class="ayv-pc" id="ayv-pc" aria-labelledby="ayv-pc-t">
    <h2 class="ayv-section-title" id="ayv-pc-t">{{heading}}</h2>
    <p class="ayv-pc-nota">{{hint}}</p>
    <p class="ayv-pc-esta">{{{thisline}}}</p>
    <form method="post" action="{{action}}" class="ayv-pc-lista">
        <input type="hidden" name="sesskey" value="{{sesskey}}">
        {{#list}}<button type="submit" class="ayv-pc-una{{#same}} ayv-pc-misma{{/same}}" name="cover" value="{{key}}"><img src="{{src}}" alt="" loading="lazy"><span class="ayv-pc-datos">{{line}}</span>{{#same}}<span class="ayv-pc-igual">{{samelabel}}</span>{{/same}}<span class="ayv-sr">{{picklabel}}</span></button>{{/list}}
    </form>
    <p class="ayv-pc-otras">
        <button type="submit" form="ayv-pc-ninguna" class="ayv-line-button ayv-line-quiet">{{nonelabel}}</button>
        <a class="ayv-line-button ayv-line-quiet ayv-pc-foto" href="{{photourl}}">{{photolabel}}</a>
    </p>
    <form id="ayv-pc-ninguna" method="post" action="{{action}}" hidden><input type="hidden" name="sesskey" value="{{sesskey}}"><input type="hidden" name="cover" value="none"></form>
</section>
